    link: "/ChildrenOfLir"
  },
  {
    term: "Fionnuala",
    pronunciation: "fin-OO-la",
    meaning: "Daughter of Lir, whose name means 'white shoulder'. The eldest and most protective of the four swan children, she cared for her brothers throughout their 900 years of enchantment.",
